<view class="upload-page">
  <scroll-view class="upload-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <view class="upload-content">
      <view class="yd-upload-screen yd-app-screen yd-upload-app">
        <view class="yd-upload-top">
          <view class="yd-upload-brand">
            <image class="yd-upload-mark" mode="aspectFit" src="/assets/reference/brand-house.png" />
            <view>
              <text>完善信息</text>
              <text>先收集线索，再生成报告</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="yd-upload-pill" bindtap="viewLatestReport">跳过</view>
        </view>

        <view class="yd-upload-heading">
          <view class="yd-upload-title">收集线索碎片 🧩</view>
          <view class="yd-upload-sub">材料越真实，建议越具体。直接拍照或打字都可以，不必全部填满哦～</view>
        </view>

        <view class="upload-evidence-grid">
          <view class="upload-evidence-card primary" data-type="wrong_question" bindtap="openMaterialReportPanel"><image mode="aspectFit" src="/assets/reference/upload-folder-stack-transparent.png" /><text class="upload-evidence-copy"><text>错题描述</text><text>记录孩子常卡住的题型，已添加 1 份：“昨天数学卷子大题第二问，总是列错方程...”</text></text><text>已添加 1 份</text></view>
          <view class="upload-evidence-card" data-type="score_sheet" bindtap="openMaterialReportPanel"><image mode="aspectFit" src="/assets/reference/report-radar-card-illustration.png" /><text class="upload-evidence-copy"><text>成绩/周测</text><text>支持拍照识别，只做私有线索，观察波动和错题分布。</text></text><text>补充</text></view>
          <view class="upload-evidence-card" data-type="school_material" bindtap="openMaterialReportPanel"><image mode="aspectFit" src="/assets/reference/tutor-socratic-board-transparent.png" /><text class="upload-evidence-copy"><text>老师反馈</text><text>评语或聊天截图，帮助定位课堂里的真实卡点。</text></text><text>补充</text></view>
          <view class="upload-evidence-card" data-type="parent_report" bindtap="openMaterialReportPanel"><image mode="aspectFit" src="/assets/reference/family-avatar-group-transparent.png" /><text class="upload-evidence-copy"><text>家长观察</text><text>随手写几句现状，记录抗挫、拖延和开始难度。</text></text><text>补充</text></view>
          <view class="upload-evidence-card" data-type="assessment" bindtap="openMaterialReportPanel"><image mode="aspectFit" src="/assets/reference/learning-route-map-transparent.png" /><text class="upload-evidence-copy"><text>测评摘要</text><text>导入过往诊断，和错题记录一起生成培养建议。</text></text><text>补充</text></view>
        </view>

        <view class="upload-intake-workbench" wx:if="{{showMaterialPanel}}">
          <view class="upload-workbench-head"><text>粘贴材料</text><text>生成前先看证据</text></view>
          <textarea class="upload-textarea" value="{{homeworkText}}" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="1200" placeholder="例：数学应用题 4 道，孩子卡在等量关系；英语听写 20 个，容易错前 8 个。" />
          <view class="upload-workbench-actions"><text bindtap="chooseImage">照片留存</text><text data-type="parent_report" bindtap="openMaterialReportPanel">补充观察</text></view>
        </view>

        <view class="upload-material-panel" wx:if="{{showMaterialPanel}}">
          <view class="upload-workbench-head"><text>补充报告证据</text><text bindtap="toggleMaterialPanel">收起</text></view>
          <textarea class="upload-textarea material" value="{{materialText}}" bindinput="onMaterialInput" maxlength="1600" placeholder="粘贴测评摘要、老师反馈、错题描述或家长观察。必须有真实作业/错题锚点，报告才放行。" />
          <view class="upload-workbench-actions"><text data-type="parent_report" bindtap="setMaterialType">家长观察</text><text data-type="score_sheet" bindtap="setMaterialType">成绩/周测</text><text data-type="school_material" bindtap="setMaterialType">老师反馈</text></view>
          <text class="upload-material-submit" bindtap="importMaterialPack">生成成长报告</text>
        </view>

        <view class="upload-unlock-panel">
          <text>生成报告后，将解锁：</text>
          <view><text>专属学习偏好</text><text>如：更适合图像、复述还是动手拆步</text></view>
          <view><text>深层卡点定位</text><text>如：概念脱节、审题跳步或记忆负担</text></view>
          <view><text>今晚行动建议</text><text>给孩子一个可开始的小动作</text></view>
        </view>

        <view class="yd-upload-primary" bindtap="submit">生成成长报告</view>
        <view class="upload-report-ready" wx:if="{{lastReportCta}}">
          <text class="upload-report-title">{{lastReportCta.reportReadiness && lastReportCta.reportReadiness.banner ? lastReportCta.reportReadiness.banner : '材料结果'}} · {{lastReportCta.title}}</text><block wx:if="{{parentReportWorkflowView}}">
            <text class="upload-report-flow">{{parentReportWorkflowView.loopLine}}</text>
            <text class="upload-report-flow">{{parentReportWorkflowView.statusLine}}</text>
            <text class="upload-report-flow">{{parentReportWorkflowView.reasoningLine}}</text>
            <text class="upload-report-flow">{{parentReportWorkflowView.imageLine}}</text>
          </block>
          <text class="upload-workflow-actions" wx:if="{{parentReportWorkflowView}}"><text data-workflow="source" bindtap="openReportWorkflowRoute">资料包</text><text data-workflow="modules" bindtap="openReportWorkflowRoute">模块路线</text><text data-workflow="preview" bindtap="openReportWorkflowRoute">报告预览</text></text>
          <view class="upload-report-actions"><text bindtap="viewLatestReport">查看成长报告</text><text bindtap="runReportFollowupAction">{{lastReportCta.actionLabel}}</text></view>
        </view>

      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
